<p><strong>Put on your Sunday clothes, there's lots of world out there!</strong></p>
<p>The universe is a busy place.</p>
<p>This is the first of more planned articles that involve the large presence of aliens in Ortothan groups, the mythos, and the Church of the Second Hytoth itself (Note that not all Ortothans are a part of the CotSH, that's just the largest Ortothan group on Earth, which is mainly human. There's a lot more groups and lone Ortothans out there.). This will also the first of more planned articles featuring the Extrasolar Activities Department, which should a lot of fun to write.</p>
